('GRE_3','GRE_3_3381','infect','ɪn''fɛkt','ɪn''fekt','[v] 传染； 使感染， 侵染； 污染','People with the virus may feel perfectly well, but they can still infect others.  带有这种病毒的人可能毫无症状，却仍可能传染他人。'),
